    <string name="about_description">Ritu is a personal, open-source period tracker built by Rujul.\n\nYour data never leaves your device — no accounts, no ads, no servers. Track yourself, family and friends in one app, each with their own private cycle history.</string>
    <string name="about_fork_notice">Ritu is a fork of YIMA, the private period tracker by Novawerk. We added multi-person tracking so you can follow cycles for the people you care about — not just yourself.</string>
    <string name="about_upstream_credit">Based on YIMA by Novawerk · github.com/Novawerk/YIMA</string>
    <string name="about_license_note">Both projects are open source under the MIT License.</string>
